     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear Abel,</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you very much for your detailed response. I understand quite well your points. Actually, my missing points are bilateral, I mean I have the left point but not the right one. I´ll try to understand how I can reflect such points.  I´m wondering to know how I can proceed to perform the reflected relabeling you have mentioned.</div><div><br></div><div>All best,</div><div><br></div><div>Pablo<br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
